ncident list, confirmed nothing had been created, then tried again with the same request key so it couldn't make a duplicate. You have one incident, INC-0001.\n- **payments-api has not recovered:** it's still on v5.1.0 at 18% errors. When I checked, the worker rollback had only just finished, so the API may need a few minutes to clear. If the errors don't drop, the API's own release could be causing them, separately from the worker. It's v5.1.0, marked degraded in its release history. Its last healthy release was v5.0.0.\n\nI didn't change payments-api. I can check it again in a few minutes. If it's still failing, I can roll it back to v5.0.0 too, but only if you say so.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01MV3FBWqTCvuR2BJeHNxNwY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01W8Xi33HSYeYB1njxPizNQ8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012f2sVTjvQ8pDtVcLiQWTgv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_012fZVjwjKKyFh83iTBzPkgi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01M2pi1RKnc8eqqNMRnzAtLJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service", "confidence": 0.5}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01EVaXRvD4YQPL9UTg1f4KdW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-worker", "confidence": 0